    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>News</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, I'm a new game developer and this is my first game! ^^</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On my twitter page\u00a0<strong>&quot;FreljordGames&quot;\u00a0</strong>you can send me suggestions for adjustments and expansions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned future features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Asteroids will collide with the screen edges and bounce off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Additional weapon types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Upgrades for weapon strength, health points, speed, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improvements to UI &amp; graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun playing! ^^</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Space Invaders</i> and <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, <i>Interstellar Survivor</i> is a space shooter where you face an endless onslaught of asteroids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently you can navigate left and right with your spaceship, which will fire automatically and can destroy incoming asteroids to increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your HP runs out, the game is over, and you will need to press &quot;Alt + F4&quot; to exit the game until a menu is implemented.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Space Invaders</i> and <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, <i>Interstellar Survivor</i> is a space shooter where you face an endless onslaught of asteroids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently you can navigate left and right with your spaceship, which will fire automatically and can destroy incoming asteroids to increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your HP runs out, the game is over, and you will need to press &quot;Alt + F4&quot; to exit the game until a menu is implemented.</p>",
